flowchart LR
    SOURCE[Input source] --> PIPELINE[Preprocess, parse, verify, encode]
    PIPELINE --> STAGE[Exclusive sibling output]
    STAGE --> CLOSE[Check stream and close]
    CLOSE --> SUCCESS{Compilation and linking succeed?}
    SUCCESS -->|Yes| RENAME[Atomic rename to destination]
    SUCCESS -->|No| DISCARD[Delete owned staging file]
    DISCARD --> PRIOR[Preserve prior destination]
